  "blocker": "blocked_input_definition: Main Fig1 identifies PM6/BTP-eC9 but the available SI contains no atom-resolved capped pair models. Exact cut bonds, caps, charge validation and enlarged matched fragments remain unverified. Release requires independently checked full mapped fragment graphs and a truncation-pair pilot; M3 alone is insufficient.",
  "input_preparation": "Mapped graph extraction and formula/charge checks only; source optimized coordinates are not public new answers.",
  "first_version_spec": {
    "matrix": "M3 分别与一个来源明确的 PM6 片段和一个真实受体片段配对，设多个合理接触及冻结/松弛几何控制；至少一组增大片段检查截短。",
    "accept": "全四极矩使用同原点/单位，作用能、畸变、静电/色散项使用可复核同一分解规范。比较两类相互作用的证据，不能由 Qzz 直接推双重结合或器件 PCE；分解不是唯一可观测因果。",
    "optional": "体相共混形貌和器件模拟不加入。",
    "pilot": "先固定受体名称/片段截断键和电荷；试 Psi4 SAPT 可承受性，替代分解必须重新定义，不能混用项名。"
  },
